*~

# Orchard prototype (Vite + React)
orchard-prototype/node_modules/
orchard-prototype/dist/

# Sleeper's Tomb demo: the raw Windows exe is about 109 MiB, over GitHub's 100 MiB
# per-file push limit. The pages serve a zip of it instead (see _data/sleepers_tomb.yml),
# so every version's exe stays out of git.
sleepers-tomb/builds/**/*.exe
